From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: helios-packages <helios-packages@invalid>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 21:23:40 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] mppdec: pass the crop meta as a GstMeta

gst_buffer_remove_meta() takes a GstMeta *, and crop is a
GstVideoCropMeta *. GCC 14 makes incompatible pointer types an error, so
the plugin did not build on Debian Trixie. Pass its GstMeta member.
---
 gst/rockchipmpp/gstmppdec.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/gst/rockchipmpp/gstmppdec.c b/gst/rockchipmpp/gstmppdec.c
index b950073..78f37a9 100644
--- a/gst/rockchipmpp/gstmppdec.c
+++ b/gst/rockchipmpp/gstmppdec.c
@@ -857,7 +857,7 @@ gst_mpp_dec_rga_convert (GstVideoDecoder * decoder, MppFrame mframe,
 
   if (crop && ret) {
     // We've already cropped the frame with RGA, remove the crop meta
-    gst_buffer_remove_meta(buffer, crop);
+    gst_buffer_remove_meta(buffer, &crop->meta);
   }
 
   return ret;
-- 
2.47.3

